{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>For they are wholly given to Me.</b> Given of their own accord — they gave themselves to My service, as He testified in saying: מִי לַה׳ אֵלָי, and all the children of Levi gathered themselves to him (Exodus 32:26)." "And given as well <b>from among the children of Israel.</b> That they give the maintenance of the Levites through the first tithe in exchange for their service, so that My service is performed among all of them." "<b>In place of every firstborn.</b> Upon whom the service had been laid."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:39:01.724802443Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}